OL,3,GNEWSAThree people taken to hospital
OL,4,Afollowing flat fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been taken to
OL,7,Fhospital suffering from smoke
OL,8,Finhalation following a fire in a block
OL,9,Fof flats.
OL,11,FFirefighters said they were called at
OL,12,F15:30 BST to Willow Place, in the
OL,13,Fcentre of Corby, to a blaze on the
OL,14,Fsecond floor of a three-storey building
OL,15,Fthat had homes and retail units.
OL,17,FThe fire was extinguished after about
OL,18,Ftwo hours and smoke was cleared from
OL,19,Faffected areas, a Northamptonshire Fire
OL,20,Fand Rescue Service spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
